WEBVTT

00:00:56.273 --> 00:01:00.725
KHLOPUSHKA. SEGODNYA VTOROE NOYABRA TYSYACHA DEVYAT'SOT DEVYANOSTO SED'MOGO GODA.

00:01:00.725 --> 00:01:03.121
INTERV'YUIRUEMAYA: BRUKHA FEL'DMAN.

00:01:03.121 --> 00:01:05.885
INTERV'YUIRUYUSHCHIY: LEONID SAPOZHNIKOV.

00:01:05.908 --> 00:01:08.264
STRANA: UKRAINA. YAZYK INTERV'YU:

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.221
IDISH, RUSSKIY.

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.956
KASSETA NOMER ODIN.

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.102
GOROD: BERSHAD'.

00:01:25.146 --> 00:01:28.920
SEGODNYA VTOROE NOYABRA TYSYACHA DEVYAT'SOT DEVYANOSTO SED'MOGO GODA.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.536
MY NAKHODIMSYA V GORODE BERSHAD'.

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:33.538
BERЁМ INTERV'YU

00:01:33.538 --> 00:01:35.838
U FEL'DMAN BRUKHI MOSHKOVNY.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.842
INTERV'YU BERЁT LEONID SAPOZHNIKOV.

00:01:40.519 --> 00:01:44.445
MY NAKHODIMSYA NA UKRAINE V VINNITSKOY OBLASTI. YAZYK INTERV'YU:

00:01:44.518 --> 00:01:46.284
RUSSKIY I IDISH.

00:01:46.493 --> 00:01:48.157
KASSETA NOMER ODIN.

00:01:51.184 --> 00:01:56.882
NAZOVITE, POZHALUYSTA, CHLENORAZDEL'NO I MEDLENNO SVOЁ POLNOE IMYA I FAMILIYU.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.071
FEL'DMAN BRUKHA MOSHKOVNA.

00:02:00.398 --> 00:02:03.379
SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, VY RODILIS' V KAKOM GORODE?

00:02:03.503 --> 00:02:05.032
V GORODE BERSHAD'.

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:05.775
V KAKOM GODU?

00:02:06.372 --> 00:02:09.319
V TYSYACHA DEVYAT'SOT TRIDTSAT' VOS'MOM GODU.

00:02:10.287 --> 00:02:13.605
SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, VY RODILIS', V EVREYSKOY SEM'E?

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:15.073
EVREYSKAYA SEM'YA.

00:02:15.012 --> 00:02:17.469
VY MOZHETE RASSKAZAT' NAM O SVOEY SEM'E?

00:02:17.543 --> 00:02:18.465
MOGU.

00:02:18.252 --> 00:02:19.320
POZHALUYSTA.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:27.930
nu, MOYA SEM'YA BYL⟨A⟩ FEL'DMAN., Moyshe Sh⟨a⟩pshovitsh — PAPA,

00:02:28.326 --> 00:02:29.872
geven mayn foter.

00:02:30.132 --> 00:02:31.386
der foter

00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:33.450
iz gefaln oyfn front.

00:02:33.692 --> 00:02:35.880
ikh bin ibergeblibn mit der mamen

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:38.749
a kleyne. ikh bin geven alt dray yor.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.516
di mame hot mir VOSPITYVAet.

00:02:41.573 --> 00:02:44.267
dernokh dem iz di mame gevorn blind.

00:02:44.779 --> 00:02:48.452
zi iz gevorn blind, di mame, un ikh hob zikh gemutshet mit ir.

00:02:48.508 --> 00:02:52.518
ikh hob gearbet oyf der SUSHARKe akht yor.

00:02:52.609 --> 00:02:55.337
fun der SUSHARKe bin ikh gegangen arbetn

00:02:55.444 --> 00:02:57.680
in MEBEL'Ne. DA.

00:02:56.592 --> 00:02:58.546
 BRUNYA,

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:58.965
ha?

00:02:58.546 --> 00:03:07.040
 YA POPROSHU VAS SEYCHAS, RASSKAZAT' TO, CHTO VY POMNITE OT VOENNOGO VREMENI, TO, CHTO VAM RASSKAZYVALA MAMA.

00:03:05.805 --> 00:03:10.662
a. nu, OT, OT VOENN⟨OGO⟩ VREMENI gedenk ikh

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.080
VY BYLI... OT VOENN⟨OGO VREMENI⟩.

00:03:10.662 --> 00:03:12.780
az ikh bin geven alt dray yor,

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.558
der pape iz avekgegangen oyf der milkhome,

00:03:15.558 --> 00:03:17.318
hot er gezogt der mamen,

00:03:17.318 --> 00:03:19.158
⟨CHTO,⟩ "kuk tsu Brukhen,

00:03:19.158 --> 00:03:21.847
vayl zi hot ⟨ts-⟩ lib tsu loyfn oyfn veg."

00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:24.311
ot dos hot mir di mame dertseylt,

00:03:24.334 --> 00:03:26.668
hob ikh gedenkt, hob ikh fargedenkt.

00:03:26.668 --> 00:03:28.445
dernokh dem hot zi mir dertseylt,

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.356
az ikh bin geven a kleyne bin ikh gelofn koyfn shonishnik,

00:03:33.514 --> 00:03:36.506
iz di NEMTSes gelofn, nokhgelofn,

00:03:36.506 --> 00:03:39.296
un m'hot zikh NUZHDAETSYA oyf di, di yidn.

00:03:39.471 --> 00:03:43.087
nor ikh gedenk, zi hot mir dertseylt az s'iz geven bay undz a keler

00:03:43.087 --> 00:03:45.421
un mir hobn zikh gebahaltn in dem keler,

00:03:45.428 --> 00:03:50.057
me zol undz nit shlogn, me zol undz nit NUZHDAen. nu, m'hot zikh NUZHDAet in undz,

00:03:50.057 --> 00:03:53.340
⟨oyf di⟩ yidn, azoy m'hot gevolt. VSЁ.

00:03:52.212 --> 00:03:59.070
 BRUNYA, VO VREMYA VOYNY, U V- S VAMI ZHILI, S MAMOY, S VAMI, ZHILI ESHCHЁ VASHI BRAT'YA I SЁSTRY,

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.778
ILI TOL'KO SЁSTRY?

00:03:59.485 --> 00:04:01.785
NE, VO VREMYA VOYNY

00:04:01.785 --> 00:04:05.436
iz di shvester, zi iz farshlaft gevorn, iz zi geshtorbn.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.617
VO VREMYA VOYNY?

00:04:05.897 --> 00:04:08.692
 DA, ⟨in, dem⟩ GOLOD.

00:04:08.783 --> 00:04:13.063
un dernokh dem, di, di shvester vos zi voynt in IZRAILe,

00:04:13.103 --> 00:04:15.572
iz zi avekgeforn in Tshernevits,

00:04:15.572 --> 00:04:17.788
vayl s'iz geven undz shtark shver

00:04:17.793 --> 00:04:19.626
di mame VYSTUPAen,

00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:22.799
iz zi avekgeforn un zi iz geven bay fremde mentshn.

00:04:22.772 --> 00:04:24.774
S-, ETO BYLO VO VREMYA VOYNY?

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:28.588
ETO BYLO VO VREMYA VOYNY I GOLODA, DA. ONA UEKHALA

00:04:29.134 --> 00:04:30.506
IZ BERSHADI,

00:04:30.506 --> 00:04:31.625
fun Bershed.

00:04:31.733 --> 00:04:33.313
VSЁ. A CHTO ESHCHЁ?

00:04:33.864 --> 00:04:34.864
UNK.

00:04:34.062 --> 00:04:42.340
 BRUNYA, RASSKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, KAK VY, VSPOMINAETE, MOZHET BYT' UNK IZ RASSKAZOV VASHEY MATERI,

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:46.251
KAK VAM DOBILOS', K- KAK MATERI VASHEY DOBILOS' VO VREMYA VOYNY,

00:04:46.251 --> 00:04:51.500
 VAS SODERZHAT', KORMIT'? VED' ETO BYLO GETTO, BYLO...

00:04:50.177 --> 00:04:55.908
NU KAK? MOYA MAMA, mayn mame iz gegangen fremde mentshn vashn poln,

00:04:56.151 --> 00:04:59.742
un zi hot zikh gemutshet, un zi hot mir gegebn a shtikl broyt.

00:04:59.742 --> 00:05:02.944
un zi hot POLUCHet pensye funem papen;

00:05:02.944 --> 00:05:05.392
vifl zi hot gekent hot zi POLUCHet oyf pensye.

00:05:03.778 --> 00:05:06.877
 BRUNYA, PENSIYU ONA POLUCHALA POSLE VOYNY?

00:05:06.073 --> 00:05:07.808
PO- POSLE VOYNY,

00:05:07.808 --> 00:05:10.539
CHTO ON POGIB, vos er iz farfaln gevorn.

00:05:08.942 --> 00:05:13.998
A VO, A VO VREMYA VOYNY, ONA PROSTO RABOTALA RAZLICHNYM FIZICHESKIM TRUDOM?

00:05:11.929 --> 00:05:16.665
ONA PROSTO RABOTALA U CHUZHIKH LYUDEY, bay fremde mentshn.

00:05:17.633 --> 00:05:22.009
 ⟨V-,⟩ BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, SKOL'KO VAM BYLO LET,

00:05:22.009 --> 00:05:24.241
P- UZHE PUST' BY POSLE VOYNY,

00:05:24.241 --> 00:05:26.965
 ⟨K-⟩ ILI ⟨V-⟩ ESHCHЁ BYLA VOYNA,

00:05:26.965 --> 00:05:29.189
KOGDA VY UZHE PONYALI,

00:05:29.189 --> 00:05:36.137
 NE TOL'KO IZ RASSKAZOV MATERI, A SAMA PONY- PONYALA SAMA, CHTO BYLA V GETTO, BYLA V KONTSLAGERE,

00:05:36.137 --> 00:05:37.506
SKOL'KO VAM BYLO LET?

00:05:37.731 --> 00:05:38.906
dray yor.

00:05:38.642 --> 00:05:40.897
ETO VY UZHE NAKHODILIS',

00:05:40.347 --> 00:05:42.670
NAKHODILAS'. dray yor.

00:05:41.427 --> 00:05:45.504
A KOG- A KOGDA VY STALI PONIMAT', CHTO S VAMI ETO PROIZOSHLO?

00:05:45.527 --> 00:05:46.651
ETO BYLO...

00:05:46.354 --> 00:05:49.385
UNK ETO BYLO, TRI GO-, dray yor bin ikh geven.

00:05:48.362 --> 00:05:50.879
A VY UZHE PONIMALI, CHTO VY ⟨NA⟩⟨UNK⟩...

00:05:49.645 --> 00:05:53.537
UNK YA UZHE PONIMALA UNK vos ikh bin shoyn in geto,

00:05:53.678 --> 00:05:59.741
vos m'hot gevorfn kinder un m'hot ge- gebrent zey un, ge- di kinder, un m'hot

00:05:59.741 --> 00:06:03.892
UNK dos hob ikh oykh afile PO- POMNet. m'hot genemen kleyne kinder un m'hot zey gevorfn

00:06:03.892 --> 00:06:06.210
in fayer arayn, un m'hot zey gebrent.

00:06:06.756 --> 00:06:07.931
in Bershed?

00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:08.825
in Bershed.

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:12.369
un in Kiev iz geven a, ⟨inem yar, yo⟩.

00:06:10.502 --> 00:06:11.947
a, in Kiev, yo.

00:06:12.172 --> 00:06:16.099
MY V DANNOM SLUCHAE GOVORIM, BRUNECHKA, O BERSHADI.

00:06:15.818 --> 00:06:16.633
DA.

00:06:16.633 --> 00:06:18.865
nu, dos farshtey, dos ⟨P-⟩ gedenk ikh.

00:06:16.763 --> 00:06:18.120
⟨O BERSHADI.⟩

00:06:18.214 --> 00:06:19.271
⟨ir gedenkt...⟩

00:06:18.957 --> 00:06:19.795
DA.

00:06:20.104 --> 00:06:25.346
KAK, NACHALAS' ZHIZN' POSLE VOYNY? VOT ZAKONCHILAS' VOYNA...

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.947
nu, s'hot zikh gekontshet di, di VOYNA,

00:06:29.947 --> 00:06:31.859
iz mir oykh nit geven gring.

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:35.035
mayn mame iz oykh geven blind oyf di oygn.

00:06:35.035 --> 00:06:37.766
ikh bin geforn in Vinitse, gemakht ir a operatsye.

00:06:38.363 --> 00:06:41.793
TYAZHЁL⟨YY⟩ ZHIZN' BYL.

00:06:41.793 --> 00:06:43.943
s'iz geven a shlekhte tsayt,

00:06:44.252 --> 00:06:48.476
nor zi hot mikh VYSTUP- VOSPITYVet. zi hot keyn⟨em mikh⟩ nit avekgegebn.

00:06:48.336 --> 00:06:51.030
 SKAZHI-, BRUNYA, VY KHODILI V SHKOLU?

00:06:48.476 --> 00:06:49.359
nu.

00:06:51.053 --> 00:06:54.877
DA. ikh bin gegangen in shkole, in ⟨park⟩ shkole.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.683
V KAKOM GODU? V KAKOM GODU VY POSHLI V PERVYY KLASS?

00:06:57.364 --> 00:07:01.256
nu, ikh gedenk ve- in avoser GODU bin ikh gegangen in shkole?

00:07:01.397 --> 00:07:04.664
YA, ikh hob zikh gelernt in BALABA⟨EV⟩SKe shkole oykhet.

00:07:04.738 --> 00:07:07.246
kh'- ikh hob gearbet, un ikh hob zikh gelernt.

00:07:07.759 --> 00:07:10.216
nor ikh gedenk nit,...

00:07:09.244 --> 00:07:12.107
 VASH OTETS, USHЁL NA FRONT?

00:07:12.619 --> 00:07:13.473
DA.

00:07:13.395 --> 00:07:14.671
I TAM POGIB?

00:07:14.442 --> 00:07:15.364
POGIB.

00:07:15.336 --> 00:07:18.873
 K VAM PRISHLO IZVESHCHENIE O TOM, CHTO ON POGIB?

00:07:17.682 --> 00:07:21.101
yo, az er iz, PROPAL BEZ IZVESTIYA.

00:07:20.517 --> 00:07:25.151
VY POMNITE ETO, KAK PRISHLO, KAK VAM SKAZALA MAMA, CHTO OTETS POGIB?

00:07:24.398 --> 00:07:28.307
nu, ONA SKAZALA, zi hot gezogt, "⟨p-⟩ der pape iz nishto," I VSЁ.

00:07:29.724 --> 00:07:34.702
 I VAM POTOM, KOGDA VY STALI STARSHE, ⟨VAM STALI P⟩⟨UNK⟩ PONYATN⟨O⟩, CHTO...

00:07:31.941 --> 00:07:38.510
nu, SKAZALI MNE, "pape, pape iz nishto," I VSЁ. nishto, zikh, ⟨oh...⟩ "der pape iz farfaln gevorn oyf der milkhome,

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.372
un du host nit keyn pape," I VSЁ.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:45.530
un ikh gedenk nokh, i- ikh bin gegangen mit ir in RAYSOBES, az me zol ir gebn pensye.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:49.114
dos gedenk ikh. di spravke hot zi aroysgenemen, me zol ir gebn pensye.

00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:53.281
 ONA POLUCHALA PENSIYU KAK, ZHENA POGIBSHEGO NA FRONTE.

00:07:50.335 --> 00:07:53.982
DA. DA. DA, MUZHA.

00:07:53.828 --> 00:07:55.931
I NA ETI DEN'GI VY ZHILI?

00:07:56.055 --> 00:08:02.231
MY ZHILI NA ETI DEN'GI. ⟨A CHTO,⟩ UNK ⟨mir hobn⟩ gedarft UNK lebn oyf di, dem gelt, tsi neyn?

00:08:02.113 --> 00:08:04.203
SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, SKOL'KO,

00:08:04.203 --> 00:08:07.896
 KLASSOV VY ZAKONCHILI V SHKOLE, SKOL'KO LET VY UCHILIS'?

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:07.996
akht.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:09.568
VOSEM' KLASSOV.

00:08:08.695 --> 00:08:10.056
akht klasn.

00:08:09.943 --> 00:08:12.029
A POTOM VY POSHLI RABOTAT'?

00:08:11.968 --> 00:08:15.931
dernokh dem bin ikh gegangen, fertsn yor bin ikh geven alt, bin ikh gegangen arbetn.

00:08:15.512 --> 00:08:16.856
CHETYRNADTSAT' LET?

00:08:16.272 --> 00:08:17.228
DA.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.590
KUDA VY POSHLI RABOTAT' V CHETYRNADTSAT' LET?

00:08:19.157 --> 00:08:21.981
oyf der SUSHARKe, PLOD⟨OYAGOD⟩NYY ZAVOD,

00:08:21.981 --> 00:08:23.241
⟨ruft zikh on⟩ UNK.

00:08:23.646 --> 00:08:25.462
hob ikh opgearbet akht yor.

00:08:25.485 --> 00:08:29.194
dernokh dem iz nit geven keyn arbet, ⟨ot YA KINULAS',⟩ tsu der MEBEL'Ne.

00:08:29.194 --> 00:08:31.976
in der MEBEL'Ne hob ikh opgearbet finef un draysik yor.

00:08:32.977 --> 00:08:36.148
VY ⟨V-⟩ TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET PRORABOTALI NA MEBEL'NOY FABRIKE?

00:08:34.378 --> 00:08:36.751
DA. DA. DA.

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:36.751
KEM?

00:08:37.905 --> 00:08:39.547
in a STANKE

00:08:39.547 --> 00:08:44.041
bin ikh geven, un, a UBORSHCHITSe un, a PODSOBNe.

00:08:44.233 --> 00:08:46.876
VSЁ, CHTO, vos m'hot gezogt, dos hob ikh geton.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:47.991
VSЁ.

00:08:48.064 --> 00:08:51.984
 VAM MAMA VASHA RASSKAZYVALA V DETSTVE

00:08:51.984 --> 00:08:54.313
O TOM, CHTO VY BYLI V GETTO,

00:08:54.313 --> 00:08:56.495
KAKIE-TO PODROBNOSTI OB ETOM?

00:08:55.995 --> 00:08:58.557
NU, DA. ONA SKAZALA, CHTO,

00:08:58.557 --> 00:09:01.287
"YA TE- ikh hob dikh getrogn nokh oyf di hent,

00:09:01.287 --> 00:09:02.637
bist geven a kleyn kind,

00:09:02.637 --> 00:09:07.367
a dray yor. ikh hob dikh genemen oyf di hent, hob ikh getrogn, m'hot zikh shtark NUZHDAet in undz, I VSЁ.

00:09:07.656 --> 00:09:09.455
VOT ETO ONA VAM RAS⟨SKAZALA⟩.

00:09:08.348 --> 00:09:09.962
DA. DA.

00:09:09.597 --> 00:09:14.411
A VOOBSHCHE U VAS, VPOSLEDSTVII, POSLE VOYNY, V SEM'E VASHEY, U MAMY,

00:09:14.411 --> 00:09:17.425
 GOVORILI O TOM, CHTO BYLA VOYNA,

00:09:17.425 --> 00:09:22.163
CHTO BYLO GETTO, CHTO VY PEREZHILI VSЁ ETO. BYLI TAKIE RAZGOVORY?

00:09:20.751 --> 00:09:28.586
nu, KONECHNO s'iz geven, zi hot mir gezogt. avade hot zi mir dertseylt aldings, az s'iz geven di geto, m'hot zikh NUZHDAet un aldings, un ⟨az⟩ m'hot getribn di

00:09:28.586 --> 00:09:32.338
mentshn. m'hot getribn in Birebidzhan mentshn.

00:09:32.327 --> 00:09:33.564
UNK

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.055
oyf furlekh iz men geforn mit di ferd.

00:09:35.635 --> 00:09:37.333
zi hot mir alding dertseylt.

00:09:38.267 --> 00:09:43.068
PONYATNO., BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, KOGDA VY UCHILI V SHKOLE,

00:09:43.068 --> 00:09:45.500
S VAMI UCHILIS' EVREYSKIE DETI ESHCHЁ?

00:09:45.996 --> 00:09:47.157
KONECHNO.

00:09:47.157 --> 00:09:53.246
UCHILIS' EVREYS⟨K-⟩ yidishe kinder un goyishe kinder. s'iz dokh geven a ukraynishe shkole.

00:09:53.303 --> 00:09:55.601
 VY UCHILIS' V UKRAINS-...

00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:58.501
ikh hob zikh, mayn shvester hot zikh gelernt in a yidishe shkole. s'iz geven a yidishe shkole,

00:09:58.501 --> 00:10:01.531
hot zi mir oykh dertseylt, "ikh hob zikh gelernt in a yidishe shkole."

00:10:01.673 --> 00:10:03.323
un ikh fleg ir shraybn briv,

00:10:03.323 --> 00:10:06.864
fleg zi nit kenen OTVECHAEn mir, oyf di briv.

00:10:06.904 --> 00:10:12.200
 ikh fleg ir shraybn oyf ukraynske, zi fleg mir shraybn oyf yidish. hob ikh nit gekent leyenen oyf yidish.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:16.298
ikh ken biz ater nit, leyenen oyf yidish. redn ken ikh, un leyenen ken ikh nit.

00:10:17.046 --> 00:10:19.537
vayl ⟨az⟩ ikh hob zikh nor gelernt in a ukraynske shkole.

00:10:19.915 --> 00:10:25.953
 VY UMEETE RAZGOVARIVAT' NA IDISH, POTOMU CHTO VY OBSHCHALIS' S MAMOY NA IDISH I UNK...

00:10:23.948 --> 00:10:28.076
 VSЁ VREMYA mit der mamen geredt oyf yidish I VSЁ.

00:10:28.133 --> 00:10:29.443
A ZDES' V...

00:10:28.251 --> 00:10:32.728
un, mit der TЁTyes un mit, di briders, ale oyf yidish.

00:10:32.728 --> 00:10:33.931
derfar ken ikh.

00:10:33.516 --> 00:10:36.972
A ZDES' V MESTECHKE, V GODY VASHEGO DETSTVA,

00:10:36.972 --> 00:10:38.809
LYUDI GOVORILI NA IDISH

00:10:39.017 --> 00:10:40.141
MEZHDU SOBOY?

00:10:40.215 --> 00:10:43.904
nu, m'hot geredt un m'hot nit geredt. s'iz geven, vos m'hot nit geredt.

00:10:43.827 --> 00:10:45.981
NO VY RAZGOVARIVALI MEZHDU S⟨UNK⟩?

00:10:44.923 --> 00:10:48.555
YA RAZGOVARIVALA I BYLO MOЁ POKOLENIE vos zenen geven,

00:10:48.555 --> 00:10:50.345
vos zenen avekgeforn in IZRAILe,

00:10:50.345 --> 00:10:53.361
dortn, Trenker, SARA, dortn UNK,

00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:55.144
hob ikh geredt mit zey oyf yidish

00:10:56.618 --> 00:10:57.928
di gantse tsayt.

00:11:01.157 --> 00:11:05.083
NO POSKOL'KU VY NE KHODILI V EVREYSKUYU SHKOLU, VY PISAT' NE UMEETE.

00:11:04.785 --> 00:11:07.575
YA EVREYSKOY SHKOLY NE KH- bin nit gegangen.

00:11:06.338 --> 00:11:08.458
UNK NE KHODILI UNK...

00:11:07.575 --> 00:11:11.225
ikh bin nit gegangen. di shvester iz gegangen, oto di vos zi iz in IZRAILe.

00:11:09.443 --> 00:11:10.680
⟨A V-⟩

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:15.074
NO ONA, VASHA SESTRA, ONA UMELA PISAT' NA IDISH UNK?

00:11:13.712 --> 00:11:16.743
yo, shraybn briv un leyenen a bisl.

00:11:17.273 --> 00:11:20.510
nu, ikh hob ⟨ir,⟩ oysgelernt zi a bisl shraybn oyf ukraynske.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.037
az zi hot mir geshribn a briv,

00:11:22.037 --> 00:11:25.130
hob ikh ir geshribn, hot zi zikh shoyn oykhet gele- gelernt a bisl.

00:11:23.972 --> 00:11:25.451
ONA STARSHE VAS?

00:11:25.137 --> 00:11:26.211
STARSHE.

00:11:26.453 --> 00:11:28.691
SKOL'KO, NA SKOL'KO LET ONA STARSHE VAS?

00:11:28.056 --> 00:11:30.952
nu, a- az zi iz funem zeks un draysikstn yor,

00:11:31.195 --> 00:11:33.568
TAK, oyf tsvey yor tsi oyf dray yor.

00:11:32.833 --> 00:11:36.386
⟨tsvey yor.⟩ ZNACHIT, ONA TOZHE VO VREMYA VOYNY BYLA REBЁNKOM ESHCHЁ.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.094
DA, DA, DA.

00:11:36.814 --> 00:11:40.740
ZNACHIT, U VASHEY MAMY NA RUKAKH OSTALOS' DVOE DETEY, POLUCHAETSYA.

00:11:39.514 --> 00:11:41.077
DA. DA.

00:11:41.353 --> 00:11:45.751
I ONA VAS KAK BY VY-, VYTYAGIVALA VSE GODY VOYNY.

00:11:43.412 --> 00:11:46.579
DA. DA, VYTYAGIVALA, DA.

00:11:46.585 --> 00:11:50.796
A GDE VY ZHILI V BERSHADI ⟨V TO, VO⟩ VREMYA VOYNY? VY ETO Z- VY ZNAETE?

00:11:49.487 --> 00:11:52.873
ETO, VO VREMYA VOYNY MY ZHILI PO ULITSE NARODNAYA.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:58.138
 TAM ZHIL KOGDA-TO, ⟨oyb⟩ ir hot gekent, Khaim Doktorovitsh.

00:11:58.363 --> 00:12:02.424
TAM BYL NASH, VO VREMYA VOYNY, ETOT NASH DOM BYL TAM.

00:12:03.274 --> 00:12:06.865
NU, ZNAETE, GDE NARODNAYA...? TAM NAVERKHU, GDE ⟨KOLONKA⟩, GDE,

00:12:03.898 --> 00:12:06.474
DA, DA. TAM VY ZHILI...

00:12:06.865 --> 00:12:09.632
 vu es hot gevoynt, Monye.

00:12:09.632 --> 00:12:12.414
iz aroyf. TAM ETO BYLO NASHA ULITSA.

00:12:10.885 --> 00:12:18.743
UNK VY, ZHILI V ETOM DOME S MAMOY I S SESTROY, I- ILI TAM, I TAM ZHILI ESHCHЁ KAKIE-TO LYUDI ILI UNK...?

00:12:15.589 --> 00:12:16.589
⟨I...⟩

00:12:17.753 --> 00:12:20.261
TAM ZHIL⟨I⟩ Khaim Doktorovitsh.

00:12:19.812 --> 00:12:21.139
VO VREMYA VOYNY?

00:12:20.537 --> 00:12:22.421
VO VREMYA VOYNY, DA.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.323
I VO VREMYA GOLODA ONI TOZHE ZHILI TAM,

00:12:24.958 --> 00:12:28.445
aha. TAK ON- ONI VAS PUSTILI ZHIT' ILI KAK?

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.230
hobn zey oykh gevoynt dortn, DA.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.880
U NAS BYL SVOY DOM.

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:30.629
TAK.

00:12:29.987 --> 00:12:31.955
s'iz geven undzer shtub dortn.

00:12:31.017 --> 00:12:32.749
TAK. INTERESNO UNK...

00:12:32.704 --> 00:12:33.660
nu?

00:12:32.749 --> 00:12:35.161
aha, VA- CHAST' DOMA BYLA VA-...?

00:12:33.953 --> 00:12:35.584
CHA- yo, DA.

00:12:35.269 --> 00:12:37.138
VSЁ PONYAL UNK

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:39.617
ETO, s'iz geven halbe zeyer zayt, un undzer halbe zayt.

00:12:41.694 --> 00:12:42.694
YASNO.

00:12:43.099 --> 00:12:48.850
 SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, KOGDA VY UCHILIS' V SHKOLE, KOGDA VY STALI STARSHE,

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:53.203
 BYLO V BERSHADI, BYLO MNOGO EVREYSKIKH DETEY VASHIKH SVERSTNIKOV.

00:12:53.075 --> 00:12:54.075
UNK...

00:12:53.203 --> 00:12:59.768
 ⟨V-⟩ ONI, VY VSPOM- GOVORILI O TOM, CHTO VO VREMYA VOYNY ZDES' BYLO GETTO?

00:12:59.768 --> 00:13:01.942
⟨VY, VY VOZVRASHCHALIS'⟩...

00:13:00.531 --> 00:13:04.932
ikh hob zey gezo- kh'hob zey gezogt. zog ikh... ven ikh bin gevorn elter shoyn.

00:13:04.581 --> 00:13:05.469
DA.

00:13:04.932 --> 00:13:07.506
ikh bin shoyn geven in fiftn klas, in zekstn klas...

00:13:07.506 --> 00:13:11.696
hob ikh zey gezogt, "s'iz geven geto, s'iz geven ⟨aldings⟩, m'hot zikh NUZHDAet oyf di yidn."

00:13:12.073 --> 00:13:16.623
nu, zey hobn oysgehert un me, m'hot geredt I VSЁ. di yidn hobn geredt un aldings.

00:13:16.815 --> 00:13:19.309
mir hobn zikh OBSHCHAEt in shkole,

00:13:19.309 --> 00:13:22.026
di yidn mit di ukrayntses un aldings.

00:13:22.026 --> 00:13:23.610
mir flegn geyn in kino,

00:13:23.785 --> 00:13:29.164
fleg di yidishe meydlekh mit di yidishe yinglekh onheybn tsu redn oyf yidish. fleg shteyn kristn, flegn zey zogn,

00:13:29.164 --> 00:13:32.425
"vos redt ir oyf yidish? redt oyf goyish, mir'n oykhet farshteyn!"

00:13:32.931 --> 00:13:34.832
ETO YA TOZHE POMNYU.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:40.842
NO BY-, BYLI TAKIE MOL-, MOLODYE LYUDI, PARNI, DEVUSHKI, KOTORYE KHOROSHO,

00:13:39.478 --> 00:13:42.036
NU, IZ MOIKH GODAKH? KONECHNO.

00:13:40.842 --> 00:13:44.501
KHOROSHO RAZGOVARIVALI NA IDISH I DRUG S DRUGOM OBSHCHALIS'.

00:13:42.036 --> 00:13:44.657
RAZGO- DA, ONI RAZGOVARIVALI, DA.

00:13:44.657 --> 00:13:48.989
NU, BYLI MNOGO, m'hot nit gekent redn, un MNOGO, DA, RAZOGARIVALI.

00:13:49.772 --> 00:13:52.685
 mayn VOZRAST hot men geredt.

00:13:52.827 --> 00:13:57.580
 VY VSYU SVOYU ZHIZN', CHASTO ISPOL'ZUETE YAZYK IDISH?

00:13:57.653 --> 00:13:58.777
yidish?

00:13:58.345 --> 00:13:59.064
DA.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.211
SEYCHAS DAZHE?

00:14:00.117 --> 00:14:01.697
I SEYCHAS, RAN'SHE...

00:14:01.011 --> 00:14:03.536
NU, SEYCHAS, ikh ken nit zogn...

00:14:03.536 --> 00:14:06.776
az ikh kum tsu di kinder, iz, red ikh oyf goyish.

00:14:06.799 --> 00:14:09.512
 mayn tokhter farshteyt a bisl.

00:14:09.512 --> 00:14:11.824
farshteyn farshteyt zi un redn ken zi nit,

00:14:11.824 --> 00:14:13.188
i di, i di.

00:14:12.688 --> 00:14:17.166
A KOGDA VY BYLI ⟨M- S-⟩ MOLODOY, VY OBSHCHALIS' SO SVOIMI SVERSTNIKAMI,

00:14:17.166 --> 00:14:20.022
TAK VY CHASTO ⟨UPOM-⟩ PRIMENYALI YAZYK IDISH?

00:14:20.181 --> 00:14:21.283
yidish?

00:14:20.805 --> 00:14:21.558
DA.

00:14:21.283 --> 00:14:23.533
di gantse tsayt hob ikh geredt yidish.

00:14:23.961 --> 00:14:26.250
s'iz geven a shtetl,...

00:14:25.193 --> 00:14:28.868
es iz geven a shtetl, a yidish shtetl; es iz geven yidn a sakh.

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:30.108
m'hot gekent redn.

00:14:30.108 --> 00:14:33.972
itster iz nishto keyn yidn, iz nishto tsu vemen tsu redn, darf men redn oyf goyish.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.657
yo.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.796
UNK

00:14:36.796 --> 00:14:42.874
 SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, BRUNYA, VASHA SESTRA OKONCHILA EVREYSKUYU SHKOLU POLNOST'YU, ILI ONA POTOM ⟨PERESHLA⟩?

00:14:41.697 --> 00:14:42.934
NE, NE.

00:14:42.874 --> 00:14:43.999
ONA UNK...

00:14:42.934 --> 00:14:44.863
zi hot gekontshet ⟨mistome⟩ dray klasn.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.483
meyn hot zi nit gekontshet.

00:14:45.021 --> 00:14:47.129
⟨, A,⟩ A POTOM?

00:14:47.569 --> 00:14:51.039
nu, POTOM iz zi geven bay mentshn, a nanke.

00:14:50.556 --> 00:14:52.423
ah, ONA RABOTALA POTOM?

00:14:51.467 --> 00:14:54.092
RABOTALA U, bay di gevirim,

00:14:54.092 --> 00:14:57.991
bay di yidn, bay di gevirim. zi hot, gevashn, genyantshet kinder.

00:14:55.348 --> 00:15:03.027
 UNK SLEDUET PONIMAT', CHTO U VASHEY MATERI NE BYLO VOZMOZHNOSTI, UCHIT' VAS, SODERZHAT',

00:14:58.099 --> 00:14:59.038
⟨s'iz geven...⟩

00:15:00.888 --> 00:15:03.768
NE, neyn. s'iz nit geven, KONECHNO nit.

00:15:03.229 --> 00:15:05.551
I ONA VYNUZHDENA BYLA, CHTOBY,

00:15:04.377 --> 00:15:10.986
ONA VYNUZHDENA BYLA, UNK zol avekforn eyne, un eyne b- un ikh zol blaybn. kh'bin geven a kleyne, di same klenste.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.729
 DETI TOZHE RABOTALI?

00:15:10.929 --> 00:15:13.686
A KUDA ONA UEKHALA, VASHA SESTRA, TOGDA?

00:15:12.865 --> 00:15:15.036
ONA, zi iz geven in Tshernevits.

00:15:15.036 --> 00:15:22.345
fun Tshernevits iz zi avekgeforn in Stri, L'VOVSKAYA OBLAST', un dortn hot zi khasene gehat. dortn hot zi gepakt a yingl UNK hot khasene gehat, I VSЁ.

00:15:22.345 --> 00:15:24.203
zi hot tsvey kinder mit im,

00:15:24.913 --> 00:15:25.784
a yid?

00:15:25.314 --> 00:15:26.966
un eyniklekh. a yid.

00:15:27.867 --> 00:15:28.981
yo.

00:15:28.018 --> 00:15:29.986
ONI ZHILI V STRYYU DOLGO?

00:15:29.453 --> 00:15:32.383
, KONECHNO.

00:15:32.136 --> 00:15:33.649
SKOL'KO LET ZHILI?

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.783
OCHEN' DOLGO.

00:15:33.942 --> 00:15:36.849
 az zey zenen avekgeforn in IZRAILe

00:15:36.849 --> 00:15:39.267
iz di tokhter ire geven draysik yor,

00:15:39.274 --> 00:15:41.934
nor zi iz shoyn in IZRAILe ersht dos ferde yor.

00:15:42.717 --> 00:15:45.953
A VY, VO VREMYA IKH ZHIZNI V STRYYU,

00:15:45.953 --> 00:15:47.536
VY BYLI U NIKH V GOSTYAKH?

00:15:46.733 --> 00:15:48.080
A KAK ZHE!

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.129
geforn, az ikh, hob gehat, otpusk,

00:15:51.129 --> 00:15:53.175
bin ikh avekgeforn, ⟨bin⟩ geven a khoydesh.

00:15:51.795 --> 00:15:54.455
KOGD- KAK- KAKIE GODY ETO BYLO?

00:15:56.065 --> 00:16:00.861
NU, KAKIE? VSE GODA. UNK SKOL'KO ONA BYLA TAM V STRYYU, TAK YA BYLA.

00:15:59.249 --> 00:16:00.768
⟨SKOL'KO...⟩

00:16:00.861 --> 00:16:02.558
NU, ETO UZHE CHETVЁRTYY GOD

00:16:02.558 --> 00:16:04.563
vos zi iz shoyn in IZRAILe,

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:07.027
bin ikh nit geforn, for ikh shoyn nit.

00:16:06.277 --> 00:16:09.740
UNK ⟨nisht-⟩ shoyn nishto tsu vemen forn.

00:16:07.027 --> 00:16:09.272
zi iz dortn nishto; zi iz in IZRAIL'.

00:16:09.396 --> 00:16:11.263
iz nishto tsu vemen tsu forn.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:17.555
nu, ⟨A⟩ tsen yor, ⟨TAM⟩ tsvontsik yor, VY BYLI V STRYYU,

00:16:17.555 --> 00:16:21.438
 TAM ZHILI EVREI, KROME VASHEY SESTRY UNK?

00:16:20.314 --> 00:16:21.947
dortn veynik gevoynt.

00:16:21.947 --> 00:16:27.660
s'iz geven UNK dortn tsvey, dray ire. eyner iz geshtorbn, der anderer hot gelebt, I VSЁ, nor veynik.

00:16:26.322 --> 00:16:28.982
ETO V TE GODY, UZHE V TE GODY UNK?

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:32.444
nor m'hot gevoynt ZAPADNYE... ZAPADNYE mentshn azoyne.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.002
EVREI.

00:16:32.444 --> 00:16:34.888
NE, EVREI zenen geven SVOI.

00:16:34.783 --> 00:16:35.783
⟨SVOI⟩.

00:16:34.888 --> 00:16:35.985
nor veynik.

00:16:35.783 --> 00:16:36.592
veynik.

00:16:36.396 --> 00:16:37.335
veynik.

00:16:37.594 --> 00:16:40.536
m'hot nit gekent derkenen a yidn, tsi s'iz a yid, tsi s'iz a goy,

00:16:37.743 --> 00:16:38.743
UNK

00:16:40.536 --> 00:16:42.448
nor m'hot gevust az s'iz a yid.

00:16:42.825 --> 00:16:46.441
ZNACHIT, V TE GODY, KOGDA VASHA SESTRA UEKHALA ZHIT' V STRYY

00:16:46.441 --> 00:16:50.598
I VYSHLA TAM ZAMUZH, ONA VYSHLA ZAMUZH ZA MESTNOGO STRYYS'KOGO EVREYA.

00:16:49.913 --> 00:16:51.189
STRYYS'K⟨UNK⟩.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.569
yo. yo. ⟨a Stri-⟩...

00:16:51.297 --> 00:16:55.931
KORENNOGO EVREYA. U NEGO BYLA S-, BYLI RODITELI, BYLA SEM'YA?

00:16:55.026 --> 00:16:59.964
yo, geven a mame. di mame iz geshtorbn. geven a tate, geshtorbn. geven a shvester, geshtorbn.

00:16:59.616 --> 00:17:01.196
NO ETO BYLO V STRYYU?

00:17:00.088 --> 00:17:02.765
un der shvester's zun iz oykh in IZRAILe.

00:17:04.573 --> 00:17:07.462
ZNACHIT ⟨TAM⟩, PO SUTI DELA, CHAST' VASHEY SEM'I

00:17:07.159 --> 00:17:08.233
DA.

00:17:07.462 --> 00:17:09.076
NAKHODITSYA V IZRAILE.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.532
V IZRAIL'.

00:17:09.775 --> 00:17:12.564
NE, NE TOL'KO, NE TOL'KO ⟨d-⟩ CHAST'.

00:17:12.564 --> 00:17:15.388
ale DVOYURODNYE BRATes iz dortn bay mir do:

00:17:15.388 --> 00:17:18.490
ISAAK FEL'DMAN, dortn SASHA FEL'DMAN, ale mayne

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.129
eygene zenen in IZRAIL'.

00:17:20.575 --> 00:17:21.969
nor ikh zits do.

00:17:22.701 --> 00:17:23.657
POCHEMU?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.788
POCHEMU?

00:17:24.692 --> 00:17:25.411
DA.

00:17:25.417 --> 00:17:29.546
di kinder viln nit forn, vil ikh oykh nit forn. ikh volt gevolt forn mit der kleyner tokhter

00:17:29.569 --> 00:17:30.899
volt ikh gevolt forn.

00:17:30.899 --> 00:17:33.743
⟨iz, MYAGKOST',⟩ iz yo, zi vil yo, ⟨zi⟩ nit.

00:17:33.743 --> 00:17:37.919
ikh POLUCHAe gute briv fun mayn shvester. zi shraybt az s'iz ir gut dortn.

00:17:37.919 --> 00:17:39.843
zi shraybt az ikh'l hobn pensye

00:17:39.843 --> 00:17:43.670
un s'vet mir zayn gut, ikh'l nemen a kvartire un aldings. "vos mutshest zikh do?"

00:17:43.828 --> 00:17:47.737
 zog ikh, "ikh veys? az di kinder..." kh'hob lib di eyniklekh hob ikh lib!

00:17:48.115 --> 00:17:50.691
kh'hob lib di eyniklekh, kh'hob lib di tsvey tekhter,

00:17:50.781 --> 00:17:52.648
un vos eyne aleyn vel ikh forn?

00:17:52.671 --> 00:17:55.314
ikh toyg gornit eyne aleyn oys oyf der elter.

00:17:55.675 --> 00:17:58.521
UNK mir vet shoyn zayn in gikhn zekhtsik yor,

00:17:58.729 --> 00:18:01.194
nor kh'bin nokh ⟨BODRe⟩ a bisl.

00:18:01.699 --> 00:18:03.527
nu, vos zhe ken ikh makhn?

00:18:03.302 --> 00:18:09.050
NU, ⟨Z-⟩, KOGDA VAM ISPOLNITSYA SHEST'DESYAT LET, VY SMOZHETE PRIEKHAT' V IZRAIL' I POLUCHAT' PENSIYU.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.070
ikh veys az ikh'l hobn a pensye,

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.432
nor vos zhe zol ikh iberlozn di kinder?

00:18:13.432 --> 00:18:16.762
zey shraybn, ikh hob itster gehat a briv eyernekhtn, shraybn zey mir,

00:18:16.768 --> 00:18:19.743
 "az m'vet dikh fregn vu du vilst forn,

00:18:19.743 --> 00:18:24.325
iz gib dem adres undzern. mir'n dikh VSTRECHAen, vest opzayn tsvey vokhn bay undz

00:18:24.325 --> 00:18:27.527
dortn, tsi dray vokhn, vest zikh opzukhn a kvartire, vestu geyn mit Anyen."

00:18:27.527 --> 00:18:29.438
nor zey shraybn, ikh zol kumen mit Anyen,

00:18:29.438 --> 00:18:30.864
mit der klenerer tokhter.

00:18:30.864 --> 00:18:34.872
nu, az zi iz geven do mit ir klenerer tokhter, zog ikh, "du host dokh nit keyn arbet in Ades.

00:18:34.872 --> 00:18:37.240
du voynst in a OBSHCHEZHITIe, in eyn KOMNATe.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:38.500
kum, vel'mir forn!"

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:43.830
"ikh veys, MAMA. ikh vel nokh trakhtn, ikh vel nokh trakhtn, ikh vel trakhtn..." ⟨vos zol,⟩ ikh ken nit forn on di kinder.

00:18:43.937 --> 00:18:46.407
BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, KAK VY SCHITAETE,

00:18:46.407 --> 00:18:53.546
 TO, CHTO VOZNIKLA VOZMOZHNOST' UEZZHAT', V IZRAIL', UEZZHAT' V EVREYSKOE GOSUDARSTVO, ZHIT' TAM,

00:18:53.546 --> 00:18:58.865
ETO IMELO ZNACHENIE V TOM, CHTO V BERSHADI OSTALOS' MALO EVREEV?

00:18:59.496 --> 00:19:02.420
nu, vos ken ikh aykh zogn? s'iz,

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:05.555
 tsi s'iz dortn gut, tsi s'iz nisht gut.

00:19:05.555 --> 00:19:09.187
ikh hob do eyn KOMNATe. m'hot mir gegebn a KOMNATe,

00:19:09.187 --> 00:19:11.440
iz, heyts ikh nit aleyn.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.098
ikh tsol finef un tsvontsik protsentn.

00:19:14.098 --> 00:19:16.334
ikh SCHITAe zikh BOYOVYKH DIY,

00:19:16.334 --> 00:19:18.592
 KAK MALOLETN⟨IY⟩ UZ⟨UNK⟩,

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:21.499
un ikh tsol finef un tsvontsik protsentn,

00:19:21.499 --> 00:19:23.320
un hungerik bin ikh nit do,

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:27.480
un ikh veys, keyner tshepet mikh nit dervayl. ikh veys nit vos s'vet zayn, vayter,

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.935
nor me tshepet mikh nit.

00:19:28.935 --> 00:19:32.075
nu, me zogt a mol, me ruft mikh on mitn nomen.

00:19:32.335 --> 00:19:34.761
nu, shvayg ikh. vos zol ikh ton?

00:19:34.761 --> 00:19:38.100
un az kh'hob gearbet oyf der arbet, me fleg mikh oykh onrufn mitn nomen.

00:19:38.528 --> 00:19:40.833
VSЁ. me fleg mir zogn "ZHYD".

00:19:41.211 --> 00:19:43.230
nu, vos zhe, v- vos zhe ken men makhn?

00:19:43.557 --> 00:19:48.900
nu, veys ikh tsi in IZRAIL'... ikh veys ⟨az in⟩ IZRAILe, s'vet mir oykh nit zayn shlekht, vayl ikh'l hobn pensye.

00:19:48.957 --> 00:19:51.485
nu, KONECHNO, eyder kh'vel zikh ⟨OSTANOV⟩en.

00:19:51.485 --> 00:19:56.420
un do iz, se shteyt bay mir a televizor, se shteyt bay mir dos, se shteyt ⟨bay mir, vert⟩ tsebrokhn.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.981
ikh farkoyf aldings.

00:19:57.981 --> 00:20:01.685
ikh darf farkoyfn. un di shtub hob ikh oykhet gekoyft, di KOMNATe.

00:20:01.685 --> 00:20:03.429
ikh darf zi oykhet farkoyfn.

00:20:03.807 --> 00:20:05.481
un ikh veys nit vos tsu tun.

00:20:05.481 --> 00:20:09.538
nor ven dos kind iz, SOGLASNe, volt ikh, ⟨RADI dem kind⟩.

00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:15.231
⟨ZNACHIT ESLI,⟩ MOZHNO PONIMAT', CHTO ESLI BY MLADSHAYA DOCH' SAMA VAM SKAZALA, CHTO, "BRUNYA, D- MAMA, DAVAYTE POEZZHAEM,"

00:20:13.206 --> 00:20:14.364
DA.

00:20:15.079 --> 00:20:16.595
bin ikh SOGLASNe!

00:20:15.231 --> 00:20:16.288
VY BY...

00:20:16.595 --> 00:20:18.546
bin ikh SOGLASNe, mit eyn kind.

00:20:18.546 --> 00:20:22.120
git mir dortn oykh a KOMNATe, tsi ikh NANIMAe... dortn NANIMAet men zikh...

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:24.490
NANIMAe ikh a KOMNATe, ikh POLUCHAe pensye,

00:20:24.495 --> 00:20:29.462
un zi volt POLUCHet, KAK MAT' ODINOCHKA... zi iz mit im nit tseshribn... azoy zogt men mir.

00:20:29.462 --> 00:20:33.129
ikh veys, un, un zi volt gegangen arbetn ⟨ergets⟩ I VSЁ, kh'veys.

00:20:33.928 --> 00:20:35.964
un aleyn ken ikh zikh nit reshen.

00:20:36.679 --> 00:20:42.781
s'iz a, TRUDNYY VOPROS iz dos. keyner ken mir nit zogn, "for yo. for nit."

00:20:43.716 --> 00:20:52.184
 BRUNYA, VY, KAK MNOGIE DRUGIE EVREI V BERSHADI, PODTVERDILI SVOY, SVOY, FAKT SVOEGO PREBYVANIYA V BERSHADSKOM GETTO

00:20:52.184 --> 00:20:53.846
DOKUMEN- DOKUMENTOM.

00:20:53.846 --> 00:20:56.080
U VAS EST' SOOTVETSTVUYUSHCHI⟨Y⟩ DOKU⟨MENT⟩...

00:20:54.533 --> 00:20:59.074
U M- bay mir iz do ale D- DOKUMENTn⟨, azoy vi in⟩ arkhiv iz do bay mir,

00:20:58.735 --> 00:20:59.792
U VAS ⟨EST'⟩...

00:20:59.074 --> 00:21:02.815
un a bikhele iz do bay mir, un itster darf... nor dos bikhele iz in VOENKOMAT,

00:21:02.815 --> 00:21:05.313
vayl ikh darf nemen a bikhele vos ikh bin BOYOVYKH DIY.

00:21:05.313 --> 00:21:06.882
m'hot mir NABAVet pensye.

00:21:06.882 --> 00:21:08.426
kh'hob POLUCHet pensye,

00:21:08.426 --> 00:21:14.388
 fuftsik grivnes. itster POLUCH⟨- ikh -Ae⟩ SHEST'DESYAT PYAT', finef un zekhtsik,

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.819
vayl m'hot NABAVet fuftsn.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:22.814
NO U VAS EST' VSE NEOBKHODIMYE DOKUMENTY O TOM, CHTO VY BYLI V GETTO, DA?

00:21:21.988 --> 00:21:24.583
EST'. aldings iz do bay mir.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.925
A KTO UNK V- DAL ETI DOKUMENTY?

00:21:26.292 --> 00:21:30.167
ikh bin gegangen in RAYSOBES un ikh hob genemen tsvey SVIDETELes,

00:21:30.308 --> 00:21:36.870
un, di SVIDETELes hobn gezogt, DEYSTVITEL'Ne kh'bin geven in Bershed, ikh hob gehat, tsvey, ikh bin geven alt dray yor,

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.725
un ikh hob zikh gemutshet mit der mamen.

00:21:38.725 --> 00:21:46.286
vu m'hot getribn der mamen, hot men mikh oykh getribn. zi hot mikh gehaltn, dray yor, vos ikh bin geven a kind; ⟨lebn a hent-,⟩ hentele hot zi mikh getrogn, gefirt.

00:21:45.985 --> 00:21:47.059
⟨NU,⟩ KONECHNO.

00:21:48.702 --> 00:21:55.361
A VY POMNITE..., VED' I VY I VASHA SESTRA, V GODY VOYNY BYLI, PO SUTI, MALEN'KIMI ESHCHЁ DET'MI,

00:21:55.219 --> 00:21:56.219
⟨nu...⟩

00:21:55.361 --> 00:22:01.673
BYLO ⟨TAM⟩ PUST' BY CHETYRE GODA TAM CHEREZ GOD, KAK NACHALAS' VOYNA, A STARSHEY SESTRE BYLO SHEST' LET...

00:22:01.695 --> 00:22:03.703
VY POMNITE KAKIE-TO SHTRIKHI,

00:22:03.703 --> 00:22:08.543
 TRUDNOSTI, KOTORYE ISPYTALA MAMA VASHA, NAKHODYAS' V GETTO, VOT ⟨V-⟩

00:22:08.543 --> 00:22:10.277
 S DVUMYA DET'MI?

00:22:09.778 --> 00:22:12.728
nu, KONECHNO, zi hot shtark PEREZHIVAet.

00:22:12.728 --> 00:22:14.592
zi hot PEREZHIVAet far mir,

00:22:14.592 --> 00:22:16.166
me zol mikh nit hargenen,

00:22:16.166 --> 00:22:18.212
me zol mikh nit keyn shto- shtup ton,

00:22:18.212 --> 00:22:20.046
me zol zi nit shtupn UNK.

00:22:20.046 --> 00:22:24.116
⟨⟩, zi hot PEREZHIVAet NA KAZHDOM SHAGU hot zi PEREZHIVAet fun, far di kinder.

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:27.962
az m'hot genemen,

00:22:27.962 --> 00:22:30.740
 lebedike kinder un me fleg varfn in, in,

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:38.156
in... zi hot mir dertseylt... un, un, un b- un brenen zey, un in di YAMes fleg men lebedike kinder. di mames zenen geshtanen un m'hot gekukt,

00:22:38.466 --> 00:22:41.059
un dos harts iz dokh tserisn gevorn fun der mamen.

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:49.355
⟨A⟩ SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, A KTO-TO IZ VZROSLYKH, KROME MAMY,

00:22:49.355 --> 00:22:53.794
RASSKAZYVAL VAM, POSLE VOYNY O TOM, CHTO VY BYLI V GETTO,

00:22:53.794 --> 00:22:57.951
O ZHIZNI V GETTO? KROME MAMY, KTO-TO IZ VZROSLYKH VAM GOVORIL OB ETOM?

00:22:57.889 --> 00:23:02.916
NU, GOVORIL MNE SASHA, KOGDA ON BYL, FEL'DMAN.

00:23:02.916 --> 00:23:06.219
ON MNE KOGDA-TO RASSKA-... ISAAK MNE KOGDA-TO RASSKAZYVAL.

00:23:07.035 --> 00:23:13.526
VOT, ONI MNE TOZHE RASSKAZYVALI KAK BYLO TYAZHELO, KAK VOOBSHCHE ZHILOS', di, di yidn,

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:16.242
azoy m'hot zikh shtark NUZHDAETSYA oyf di, di yidn.

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:26.286
 A CHTO VASH, KAK VASH, A VY SVOIM DOCHERYAM OB ETOM RASSKAZYVALI?

00:23:26.286 --> 00:23:28.308
ONI, ONI ZNAYUT ETO?

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:28.421
KONECHNO, KONECHNO, DA.

00:23:28.421 --> 00:23:32.741
I VOT MOYA STARSHAYA DOCHKA zogt, dem, eydem,

00:23:32.741 --> 00:23:38.499
CHTO, "o, VITYA, ven du veyst azoy m'hot zikh NUZHDAet nokh mayn mamen.

00:23:38.499 --> 00:23:42.520
du meynst, umzist hot men ir gegebn di bikhelekh. ⟨umzist⟩ git men nit keyn bikhelekh.

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:43.980
m'hot zikh gut NUZHDAet.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.072
KHOTYA," zogt zi, "ikh bin nokh nit geven oyf der velt,

00:23:46.072 --> 00:23:47.749
nor mayn mame hot mir dertseylt."

00:23:47.822 --> 00:23:51.425
ikh hob ir, heyst es, dertseylt. DA.

00:23:51.484 --> 00:23:55.072
un di, dos kind vos in Ades, veyst zi oykhet un aldings.

00:23:55.264 --> 00:23:59.493
A ONI POMNYAT, VASHU MAMU, BABUSHKU SVOYU?

00:23:55.509 --> 00:23:56.338
⟨nu.⟩

00:23:59.331 --> 00:24:01.130
DA, zey veysn.

00:24:00.799 --> 00:24:02.008
ONI POMNYAT.

00:24:01.373 --> 00:24:07.138
yo. MAECHKe iz demolts geven alt, fir yor, un ANECHKe iz geven alt tsvey yor.

00:24:07.228 --> 00:24:09.267
nor ven mayn mame iz geshtorbn

00:24:09.267 --> 00:24:14.667
hob ikh zey oyfn feld nit genemen, derfar vos zey zenen geven kleyne kinder. kh'hob moyre gehat,

00:24:14.667 --> 00:24:17.460
 vos zey veln, hobn moyre.

00:24:17.460 --> 00:24:20.097
nor itstert o zogn ⟨m- zey mir⟩ a VOPROS,

00:24:20.222 --> 00:24:23.796
"mame, far vos hostu mikh nit genemen, az di bobe iz geshtorbn,

00:24:23.796 --> 00:24:29.193
⟨vuhin⟩ genemen oyf der mashin, m⟨ir zoln ze⟩n vi azoy?" nor zey geyen oyfn feld un zey veysn un aldings.

00:24:29.217 --> 00:24:33.227
un zey ⟨ge⟩denken, in der tsayt ⟨ot,⟩ ge- gedenken zey mayn mamen.

00:24:33.486 --> 00:24:35.539
mayn mame hot zey azoy vi oyfgekhovet.

00:24:37.654 --> 00:24:43.481
UNK ⟨MOZHNO⟩ SKAZAT', CHTO, VASHEY MAME UDALOS',

00:24:43.823 --> 00:24:52.675
SP- BUKVAL'NO SPASTI VAS, OT TEX, SLUCHAEV SMERTI I GIBELI LYUDEY, KOTORYE BYLI ⟨ZDES'⟩ UNK,

00:24:48.342 --> 00:24:50.925
 SM- DA.

00:24:51.525 --> 00:24:53.358
yo. yo.

00:24:52.675 --> 00:25:01.343
I K- KAK BY VYVESTI VAS V POSLEVOENNUYU ZHIZN', KOTORAYA UZHE BYLA DOSTATOCHNO MIRNA, A DAL'SHE UZHE KAK VAM V ZHIZNI POVELOS' T⟨UNK⟩

00:24:56.875 --> 00:24:57.864
yo.

00:25:00.402 --> 00:25:01.493
nu, yo.

00:25:01.343 --> 00:25:02.774
TAK VY PROZHILI.

00:25:02.393 --> 00:25:03.298
yo.

00:25:03.760 --> 00:25:05.408
SLEDOVATEL'NO...

00:25:07.590 --> 00:25:11.516
TRUDAMI VASHEY MAMY SOKHRANENA VASHA SEM'YA I,

00:25:10.307 --> 00:25:12.933
DA. DA. BLAGODARYA EY.

00:25:12.332 --> 00:25:17.101
BLAGODARYA EY SUSHCHESTVUYUT, VASHI DOCHERI I VNUKI.

00:25:13.311 --> 00:25:16.244
DA. UNK SUSHCHESTVUYUT YA

00:25:16.244 --> 00:25:20.763
I MOI, ⟨,⟩ DA, VNUKI. NU, VNUKI, NE, VNUKI ETO MOI UZHE.

00:25:20.280 --> 00:25:21.657
NU, PONYATNO.

00:25:20.871 --> 00:25:22.991
NO UNK EY VNUKI, DA.

00:25:23.672 --> 00:25:24.780
YASNO.

00:25:25.647 --> 00:25:28.657
SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, A VOT ZA VSE GODY,

00:25:28.657 --> 00:25:30.675
SKOL'KO VY PROZHILI V BERSHADI,

00:25:30.675 --> 00:25:33.240
 VOT VY RABOTALI NA MEBEL'NOY FABRIKE;

00:25:33.240 --> 00:25:36.356
TAM KOGDA-TO RABOTALO OCHEN' MNOGO EVREEV,

00:25:36.447 --> 00:25:39.580
KOGDA-TO. POTOM STALO MEN'SHE, POTOM UNK MEN'SHE.

00:25:38.353 --> 00:25:42.009
nu, KOGDA YA, ikh hob gearbet oyf der fabrike,

00:25:41.830 --> 00:25:44.507
⟨VOT⟩ RASSKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, O UNK.

00:25:42.150 --> 00:25:45.333
iz, iz... kh'hob gearbet oyf der fabrike,

00:25:45.333 --> 00:25:47.173
iz hot gearbet a sakh yidn.

00:25:47.247 --> 00:25:51.445
nu, mir flegn a mol redn oyf yidish, a mol flegn mir redn oyf goyish,

00:25:51.445 --> 00:25:53.619
nor keyner fleg undz gornit zogn.

00:25:53.878 --> 00:25:58.001
nor ikh hob gearbet oyf der fabrike. azoy ikh bin geven a yidishke,

00:25:58.001 --> 00:26:00.347
hot men zikh tsu mir OBRASHCHAet gut.

00:26:00.347 --> 00:26:02.310
s'hot zikh gearbet dortn goyim.

00:26:02.417 --> 00:26:06.224
iz a direktor a go-, geven Fishkes. er iz geven a yid.

00:26:06.332 --> 00:26:14.881
nu, iz bin ikh farshlaft gevorn, iz bin ikh gelign in BOL'NITSe, fleg Fride kumen mit im un flegn mir sh- shikn PEREDACHes. m'hot zikh shtark gut OTNOSet tsu mir.

00:26:15.259 --> 00:26:17.745
fun finef un draysik yor vos ikh hob opgearbet,

00:26:17.745 --> 00:26:20.282
hob ikh zikh nit vos tsu OBIZHAen oyf der fabrike.

00:26:20.389 --> 00:26:23.094
 yeder iz gegangen mir NAVSTRECHe.

00:26:23.094 --> 00:26:25.296
dortn arbet a goy KAPLICHNYY,

00:26:25.296 --> 00:26:30.283
iz, mayne kinder hot er gegebn in PIONERSKe lager tsvey mol

00:26:30.283 --> 00:26:33.292
tsu BESPLATNe PUTЁVKes.

00:26:33.366 --> 00:26:35.472
un mir fleg men gebn POMOSHCH'.

00:26:35.472 --> 00:26:38.046
 me, m'hot shtark mikh ZHALEet.

00:26:38.046 --> 00:26:41.544
zey hobn gevust az ikh mutshe zikh mit a mame a shlafe...

00:26:41.719 --> 00:26:45.953
 di mame iz geven shlaf un zi hot zikh gemutshet mit mir... nor zey hobn mikh nit OBIZHAet

00:26:45.953 --> 00:26:47.349
oyf der fabrike.

00:26:47.558 --> 00:26:51.799
vos ken ikh zogn? kh'hob opgearbet finef un draysik yor UNK BOL'SHINSTVO goyim,

00:26:51.799 --> 00:26:53.610
nor zey hobn mikh nit OBIZHAet.

00:26:53.852 --> 00:26:59.907
BRUNYA, RASSKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, VOT TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET RABOTY NA PREDPRIYATII, ETO DOSTATOCHNO

00:26:59.185 --> 00:27:01.946
ETO KON- avade. avade.

00:26:59.907 --> 00:27:04.944
BOL'SHOE VREMYA. KOGDA VY PRISHLI RABOTAT' TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET,

00:27:04.534 --> 00:27:06.041
ven ikh bin geku-...

00:27:04.944 --> 00:27:07.987
OTO DNYA SVOEGO UKHODA NA PENSIYU,

00:27:06.041 --> 00:27:10.164
a. ven ikh bin gekumen arbetn in, MEBEL'Ne...

00:27:09.529 --> 00:27:11.717
CHTO ONO SOBOY PREDSTAVLYALO TOGDA?

00:27:11.858 --> 00:27:13.387
di fabrike?

00:27:12.567 --> 00:27:15.109
FABRIKA I LYUDI, KOTORYE RABOTALI.

00:27:14.288 --> 00:27:16.851
NU, LYUDI, RABOTALI EVREI,

00:27:16.851 --> 00:27:20.509
un s'hot gearbet, yidn un s'hot gearbet goyim.

00:27:20.509 --> 00:27:22.680
az ikh bin gekumen oyf der fabrike,

00:27:22.680 --> 00:27:25.360
nu, bin ikh gekumen ⟨zikh, oykh⟩ geven a kind nokh.

00:27:25.360 --> 00:27:31.527
kh'hob opgearbet dortn akht yor un dernokh dem bin ikh gekumen oyf der fabrike. hot gearbet AVERBUKH DIREKTOROM.

00:27:31.527 --> 00:27:36.028
zog ikh, "nu, ikh," KHOTYA vos ⟨er iz⟩ geven a yid, bin ikh arayngegangen, zog ikh, "ikh vil geyn arbetn."

00:27:36.028 --> 00:27:37.311
zogt er tsu mir,

00:27:37.311 --> 00:27:40.019
"vos du vest kenen arbetn iz dokh a shvere arbet."

00:27:40.019 --> 00:27:44.001
zog ikh, "nu, vu ⟨zhe vet ir⟩ mikh avekshteln?" zogt er, "kh'vel dikh avekshteln in droysn arbetn."

00:27:44.001 --> 00:27:49.297
zog ikh, "shtelt mikh avek in droysn oyf der SHTABELЁVKe." s'iz geven a SHTABELЁVKe, vos me SHTABELYUet di detaln.

00:27:49.405 --> 00:27:55.972
hot er mikh avekgeshtelt oyf der SHTABELЁVKe un ikh hob gearbet oyf der SHTABELЁVKe dray yor, un s'iz geven vinter un s'iz geven ⟨k-⟩ zumer.

00:27:55.972 --> 00:27:58.866
vinter ⟨iz mir⟩ geven kalt, nor kh'hob zikh ongeton, un azoy hob ikh opgearbet.

00:27:59.108 --> 00:28:03.981
dernokh dem bin ikh gekumen tsu im. zog ikh, "nu, ⟨s'iz, s'iz⟩ do oyf der SUSHARKe arbet, vel ikh geyn oyf mayn arbet."

00:28:03.981 --> 00:28:08.916
zogt er tsu mir, "neyn, du arbetst gut," zogt er, "vest shoyn iber⟨layb-⟩ arbetn bay mir. gey in tsekh!"

00:28:08.916 --> 00:28:13.276
bin ikh arayngegangen in tsekh un kh'hob gearbet in tsekh un, biz van⟨UNK⟩ biz in der pensye.

00:28:13.885 --> 00:28:15.527
UNK

00:28:13.975 --> 00:28:21.647
az, az ikh bin avekgegangen ⟨tsu⟩ der pensye arbetn, ikh hob avekgegangen fun der pensye, hot men mikh oykhet BLAGODARet un m'hot mir gegebn, gelt,

00:28:22.142 --> 00:28:24.749
un ikh veys, VSЁ.

00:28:24.808 --> 00:28:26.675
TAK PROSHLO TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET.

00:28:25.973 --> 00:28:30.337
I TAK PROSHLO, geven TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET, yo, finef un draysik yor.

00:28:30.563 --> 00:28:32.211
azoy vi ersht nit lang.

00:28:34.478 --> 00:28:38.564
BRUNYA, DAVAY MY SDELAEM MALEN'KIY PERERYVCHIK.

00:28:38.089 --> 00:28:39.768
POZHALUYSTA.
